    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly offers for sale this fabulous three bedroom bungalow situated in a most convenient rural location just 4km from Carrigaline.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys a most peaceful setting on a spacious 0.5acre site, offering excellent privacy and lots of potential to extend further if required. It was extended to the rear a good number of years ago with a nice open plan kitchen/dining/living room, sun lounge, three good sized bedrooms with and bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, it has superbly maintained gardens that contains a spacious detached garage and is approached via a kerbed tarmacadam driveway with secure automated entrance gates. \r\n\r\nIt is most conveniently located just a mere five minutes drive to Carrigaline town centre and is also just minutes to local amenities and services in Ballygarvan village. It is only a short commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy, all being within a 15-20 minute drive.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended to truly this wonderful opportunity to acquire a nice home in a most popular rural location.\r\n\r\nSERVICES: Private bored well water supply, private septic tank & soak way on site, mains ESB & telephone."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.03m x 1.68m \r\nComposite front door with glazing, centre light with centre rose, carpet floor, telephone point, storage press with shelf.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living Area - 6.6m x 6.75m \r\nCarpet/Vinyl floor, centre light with centre rose, fitted solid -fuel stove with tile surround and wooden mantle, TV point, curtain poles, curtains, fitted kitchen unit with integrated, oven, hob, overhead extractor unit, tile splashback, door to rear garden, double doors to sunroom.\r\n\r\nSunroom - 3.63m x 3.05m \r\nWooden floor, window blinds, spotlights, double doors to kitchen/dining/living area\r\n\r\nRear Porch - \r\nSliding door, tile floor.  \r\n\r\nHallway - 6.07m x 1.01m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, hot press unit with shelving. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.80m x 2.82m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, curtain pole, curtains, window blind, built-in wardrobe unit\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.44m x 2.52m \r\nWooden floor, curtain pole, curtains, window blinds, fitted wardrobe unit, centre light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.65m x 2.61m \r\nWooden floor, window blind, centre light, stira stairs leading to overhead attic, plumbed for washing machine. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.79m x 2.01m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, centre globe light, WC, WHB unit with underneath storage, walk-in shower with electric shower unit and chrome enclosure.\r\n\r\nDetached Garage - 4.30m x 6.03m \r\nConcrete floor, centre fluorescent light, roller door, side door. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 98.2 sq metres (1,056 sq ft)\r\nOil Fired Central Heating\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Composite Front Door\r\nBeautifully landscaped c.0.5 acre site\r\nSouth-West facing rear garden with excellent privacy\r\nDetached Garage\r\nKerbed tarmacadam driveway with secure automated gates\r\nReady for immediate occupation\r\nMinutes drive to Carrigaline town centre\r\nShort commute to Kinsale, Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Carrigaline, coming from the Cork direction, turn right at the roundabout at the Carrigaline Court Hotel. \r\n\r\nContinue out this road for approximately 1km going through the roundabout by Carrigaline Soccer Club. Take your next left, driving over the bridge and take an immediate right. Continue up the hill, keeping right at the top and then take your next left. Stay on this road for approximately 1.5/2km and there   is an arrow sign pointing to the right along with our \"For Sale\" sign displayed at the entrance to the property. Follow Eircode: P43 WD90"
      }
